## Allowed without explicit approval

- Work on **other** inner pages or shared components **only if** changes do not alter homepage, liposuction, Lipo 360, BBL, feminine waist contouring, tummy tuck, or locked navigation output.
- If a shared file change would affect a locked page, **stop and ask** before editing.

Shared CSS in `src/app/premium.css` may only be changed when it does not alter locked page output, unless the user explicitly requests a locked page edit.

## When the user says to work on another page

Proceed on the requested page only. Leave locked pages untouched.
